WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.114
For Kovac, the Ukrainian, it is surely the
most difficult moment since his arrival at

00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:04.815
the Legion.

00:00:09.152 --> 00:00:09.852
Done.

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:15.395
I haven't changed my hairstyle since the
fifth grade.

00:00:17.496 --> 00:00:18.856
Oh there, that's a lot.

00:00:25.343 --> 00:00:27.744
That's it, done.

00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:30.865
Take a look at yourself.

00:00:37.568 --> 00:00:38.429
It is terrible.

00:00:39.469 --> 00:00:40.190
I don't like it.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:41.951
You don't like it?

00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:43.271
No, definitely not.

00:00:44.952 --> 00:00:47.114
Do you realize that it is for your whole
life?

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:48.815
Yes, but I can't do anything.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.155
This is my new life.

